---
// The root of the MENU app. Diner menus live at /{slug}; the admin is a separate app
// (see admin/), so there is nothing here to show and nothing to redirect to on this
// origin. A bare 404 is the honest answer, but a sentence is kinder than a status code.
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>BetaReal</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center;
             font: 15px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; color: #444; background: #fafafa; }
      p { margin: 0; padding: 24px; text-align: center; max-width: 36ch; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>A restaurant's menu lives at its own address. Scan the code on the table.</p>
  </body>
</html>
